{"seq":25,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:00:15.830Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"06d05e1ebf1f28bce033edc185edd957d74f9bd88e888701de37080e3aead871","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I replied to Pree in the #central-team thread. I couldn't confirm the 23 May deadline for Thornbury Cloth Co.'s signed order form.\n\n- **No record:** I found nothing about Thornbury anywhere Pree can see. There are no account files, nothing in #central-team, and nothing in the knowledge brain.\n- **Unrecorded:** Since it's unverified, I'm treating it as a rumour and didn't add it to the brain or the calendar as a deadline.\n- **Year is unclear:** It's 14 October 2026, so 23 May 2026 has already passed. If the date is real, it probably means 23 May 2027.\n- **Suggested next step:** I asked Pree to get the date and year confirmed in writing by the Thornbury contact or the account owner. Then I can add it to the calendar or set a reminder.\n\nA signing date counts as an operational fact rather than a finance figure, so no approval was needed. I also didn't mention any money terms."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000131"}}
